# the Bassline page (EDIT) and the Drum grid (EDIT three times): the bass pattern playing, a step at a time (a white
# key picks it; KNOB 2 its note, 3 its accent, 4 its length: a tie over the steps under it), heard at once; a note
# under a tie shortens it. The song's drums: a white key a step on or off for the drum KNOB 1 picks, KNOB 3 its
# level; the first edit takes the song's drums as they are made. Kept with the song, saved, back to the song's own
# with SAVE held; a format 4 save (before them) taken up with each song's own
intro off
wait 500
expect piece 0
tap EDIT
wait 200
expect view 16
# Feel: Pump (R.O.R.O.R.O.R.O.), in C: the root C2, step 2 a rest (EN_BS: note | length << 3; notes 1 root .. 6)
expect bshape 1
expect bcode0 1
expect bcode1 0
expect bhome0 36
expect bhome1 -1
tapkey w1
expect bstep 1
# step 2 a fifth: G2, heard at once
spin K2 3
expect bcode1 3
wait 200
expect bhome1 43
expect dirty 1
# step 1 tied over four: the fifth and the octave under it silent
tapkey w0
expect bstep 0
spin K4 4
expect bcode0 33
wait 200
expect bhome1 -2
expect bhome2 -2
expect bhome3 -2
shot bassline.png
# a root on step 3, under the tie: the tie ends before it (two steps)
tapkey w2
spin K2 -4
expect bcode2 1
expect bcode0 17
wait 200
expect bhome1 -2
expect bhome2 36
# its accent on (Pump's: every beat, 0x1111)
spin K3 1
expect baccs 4373
# another pattern (ALGORITHM): its own steps, ours kept in Pump
turn ALGO 2
wait 300
expect bshape 2
expect bcode1 5
turn ALGO -2
wait 300
expect bshape 1
expect bcode1 3
# the Drum grid: Feel's drums as made (the kick on every beat), until the first edit
tap EDIT
tap EDIT
wait 200
expect view 18
expect drumsedited 0
expect dlvl0.0 3
expect dlvl0.4 2
expect dlvl2.2 0
expect dlvl3.2 2
# the kick off on step 5; the song's grid from now
tapkey w4
expect dlvl0.4 0
expect dlvl0.8 2
expect dstep 4
expect drumsedited 3
# a snare on step 7, then accented
spin K1 1
expect ddrum 1
tapkey w6
expect dlvl1.6 2
spin K3 1
expect dlvl1.6 3
wait 300
shot drumgrid.png
# and off again with its key
tapkey w6
expect dlvl1.6 0
tapkey w6
# kept after a restart
tap SAVE
wait 300
reboot
wait 500
expect piece 0
expect bcode0 17
expect bcode1 3
expect bcode2 1
expect baccs 4373
expect drumsedited 3
expect dlvl0.4 0
expect dlvl1.6 2
# another song: its own (Gio: Arpeggio, its drums as made)
turn PRESET 1
wait 300
expect piece 1
expect bshape 3
expect bcode1 2
expect drumsedited 0
turn PRESET -1
wait 300
expect piece 0
expect drumsedited 3
expect bcode1 3
# SAVE held: the song back to its own, the patterns and the drums with it
press SAVE
wait 1700
release SAVE
wait 300
expect bcode0 1
expect bcode1 0
expect baccs 4369
expect drumsedited 0
expect dlvl0.4 2
# a format 4 save (before the patterns): taken up, each song's own patterns and drums
tap EDIT
tapkey w1
spin K2 3
expect bcode1 3
tap SAVE
wait 300
saved_as v4
reboot
wait 500
expect piece 0
expect bcode1 0
expect drumsedited 0
expect dlvl0.4 2
